title Video streaming
direction right

Creators [icon: camera]
Viewers [icon: monitor]

Upload [color: blue] {
  Upload API [icon: upload]
  Raw videos [icon: bucket]
}
Transcoding [color: orange] {
  Job queue [icon: queue]
  Transcoder fleet [icon: cpu, description: FFmpeg on spot]
  Thumbnailer [icon: image]
  Packager [icon: package, description: HLS / DASH]
}
Delivery [color: green] {
  Origin storage [icon: bucket]
  CDN [icon: cloudflare]
  Player [icon: video]
}
Metadata [color: purple] {
  Catalog API [icon: api]
  Catalog DB [icon: postgres, shape: cylinder]
  Recommendations [icon: brain]
}
DRM license server [icon: lock, color: red]
Analytics [icon: analytics]

Creators > Upload API > Raw videos
Raw videos --> Job queue: new upload
Job queue > Transcoder fleet > Packager > Origin storage
Transcoder fleet > Thumbnailer > Origin storage
Packager > Catalog API: renditions ready
Catalog API > Catalog DB
Origin storage > CDN > Player
Viewers > Player
Player > Catalog API, Recommendations
Player <> DRM license server: keys
Player --> Analytics: playback events
Analytics --> Recommendations
